# Everyone born at SENJ or OTOČAC in the US naturalisation petitions.
#
# 16 September 2026. Found by searching the BIRTHPLACE — `keywords=senj` (12
# filings) and `keywords=otocac` (7) — which is indexed in this record set and
# in no other on the site. The match is fuzzy, so every row below was confirmed
# by opening the transcript and reading «Birth place as transcribed».
#
# This is not a list of relatives. It is a REGISTER OF WHO LEFT TWO TOWNS, with
# an exact birth date for each, which is the one thing a parish register can be
# matched against. Two of the surnames are this archive's own — Vukelić and
# Šojat — and one, Orešković, belongs to ahnentafel 21.
#
# town|name|born|birthplace as transcribed|family|where and when they filed
